The Compliance Validation Agent performs a comprehensive audit of the draft settlement or award to ensure adherence to statutory, regulatory, and procedural norms. It checks references to IBC sections, compliance with timelines, and the inclusion of all mandatory disclosures and approvals. This automated validation step minimizes the risk of procedural defects.";}s:8:"relation";a:1:{s:10:"firstimage";s:0:"";}}s:10:"persistent";a:4:{s:4:"date";a:1:{s:7:"created";i:1761649240;}s:7:"creator";s:11:"Atul Grover";s:4:"user";s:5:"admin";s:11:"last_change";a:9:{s:4:"date";i:1761649240;s:2:"ip";s:13:"49.43.109.130";s:4:"type";s:1:"C";s:2:"id";s:76:"digital_agents:mediation_agents:decision_support:compliance_validation_agent";s:4:"user";s:5:"admin";s:3:"sum";s:7:"created";s:5:"extra";s:0:"";s:10:"sizechange";i:980;s:4:"mode";s:4:"page";}}}